# Chase — second intensifier (12 bars). Faster threat escalate than Siege.
#   0 bed   — wave pulse + pad
#   1 heat  — frantic lead
#   2 drums — noise + kick
#   3 peak  — PCM siren stabs
deck 1
bpm 156

